    "title": "Duke starts practice with goal of keeping last season's backbone, intensity - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ryan Bisesi, WRAL multiplatform producer ,\n9 hours ago Once again, it’s a group of highly praised freshmen who will tell the story for Duke in season No. 4 for coach Jon Scheyer. At all five positions last season, Duke had players who could defend a variety of positions and bother opponents with length and mobility. Offensively, there was a trio of lottery picks that could create shots for themselves and overwhelm teams with their volume of weapons. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
